 skip_serializing_if = \"Option::is_none\")]\n156\t    pub deprecation_warning: Option<String>,\n157\t}\n158\t\n159\t/// Internal execution bundle returned before the caller attaches a context handle.\n160\t#[derive(Debug, Clone)]\n161\tpub struct VerifyExplainExecution {\n162\t    /// Full explain report persisted for future `mode=explain` calls.\n163\t    pub report: ExplainReport,\n164\t    /// Target memory identity.\n165\t    pub memory_id: MemoryId,\n166\t    /// Prior structured verification status before the current verification run.\n167\t    pub prior_status: VerificationStatus,\n168\t    /// Expand-context seed derived from the memory links.\n169\t    pub expansion_seed: ExpandContextSeed,\n170\t}\n171\t\n172\tpub fn tool_definition() -> Value {\n173\t    json!({\n174\t        \"name\": \"verify_explain_memory\",\n175\t        \"description\": \"Run fresh verification checks for a durable memory or explain the last persisted verification report.\",\n176\t        \"inputSchema\": {\n177\t            \"type\": \"object\",\n178\t            \"properties\": {\n179\t                \"memory_id\": {\n180\t                    \"oneOf\": [\n181\t                        {\n182\t                            \"type\": \"object\",\n183\t                            \"properties\": {\n184\t                                \"workspace_id\": {\"type\": \"string\"},\n185\t                                \"ulid\": {\"type\": \"string\"}\n186\t                            },\n187\t                            \"required\": [\"workspace_id\", \"ulid\"]\n188\t                        },\n189\t                        {\n190\t                            \"type\": \"string\",\n191\t                            \"description\": \"Legacy compatibility form that accepts the memory ULID directly.\"\n192\t                        }\n193\t                    ]\n194\t                },\n195\t                \"mode\": {\n196\t                    \"type\": \"string\",\n197\t                    